Package: fofrCVS
Type: Package
Title: Control-Variates Transfer Learning for Function-on-Function Regression
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Ufuk", "Beyaztas",
    email = "ufukbeyaztas@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5208-4950")
  )
Description: Implements target-only, feasible control-variates (CVS), and
    penalized control-variates (pCVS) estimators for function-on-function
    linear regression with multiple functional predictors and scalar
    covariates. Local models are represented in common predictor and response
    bases and fitted by penalized least squares. Study-level coefficient,
    plug-in mean, and covariance summaries can be combined without
    transferring subject-level observations, while a group penalty in the
    integrated coefficient-function geometry protects against negative
    transfer. The package provides centralized and distributed fitting
    interfaces, coefficient extraction and reconstruction, prediction,
    numerical diagnostics, and simulation-based data generation.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    splines,
    stats
